description:
Seven years ago, Chu Yunfei was betrayed by his family and exiled in the Medicine King Valley of Zhongzhou. In the past seven years, with his own efforts, he has become famous in the cultivation circle of Zhongzhou. Afterwards, he returned to his hometown to take revenge and vowed to find out the truth of the year. However, in the process, he was repeatedly plotted against. After a difficult investigation, he was surprised to find that the black hand behind the scenes was actually the empress who is now in charge of the empire…

